  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro Music**: rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **Amp & Pedal Issues**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Chat**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **I Hear You Calling**: rare: 8 archived performances [5]\n- **Band Intros & Chat**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Mind Games**: rare: 8 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2014-07-30.AT853_24bit** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 102 min; rated 3.5/5 by 2 [1]\n- **twod2014-07-30.AT853_16bit**: source not stated; 19 songs; 102 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recorded from front row balcony, left of center; band includes Adam Granduciel and Anthony LaMarca [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2014-07-30.AT853_24bit**: taped by Dennis Orr; transferred by Dennis Orr; source: AT853 cardioid mics (in collar) > Naiant Tinybox V1.5 pre-amp (+10 db) > Edirol R-09HR > SanDisk SD Memory Card @ 24 bit/48 kHz [1]. Also: Dennis Orr handled taping and transfer, processing audio in Sound Forge and iZotope RX2 [1]\n- **twod2014-07-30.AT853_16bit**: taped by Dennis Orr; transferred by Dennis Orr; source: AT853 cardioid mics (in collar) > Naiant Tinybox V1.5 pre-amp (+10 db) > Edirol R-09HR > SanDisk SD Memory Card @ 24 bit/48 kHz [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Photo by a Flickr member (All rights reserved): [The War On Drugs @ The Rickshaw Theatre - July 30th 2014](https://www.flickr.com/photos/48070370@N03/14886392506/) [6]\n- Photo by a Flickr member (All rights reserved): [The War On Drugs @ The Rickshaw Theatre - July 30th 2014](https://www.flickr.com/photos/48070370@N03/14722724819/) [7]\n- Photo by uncredited: [the page](https://www.flickr.com/photos/48070370@N03/14886392506/) [8]\n- Photo by uncredited: [the page](https://www.flickr.com/photos/48070370@N03/14722724819/) [9]",
